<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="zh-TW"><head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" name="viewport"/>
<script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com?plugins=forms,container-queries"></script>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Work+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:wght,FILL@100..700,0..1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:wght,FILL@100..700,0..1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<script id="tailwind-config">
        tailwind.config = {
            darkMode: "class",
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        "primary": "#13ec13",
                        "background-light": "#FAF7F0",
                        "background-dark": "#102210",
                        "tea-green": "#E8F0E8",
                        "deep-brown": "#5D4037",
                        "tea-accent": "#4c9a4c"
                    },
                    fontFamily: {
                        "display": ["Work Sans", "Noto Sans TC", "sans-serif"]
                    },
                    borderRadius: {
                        "DEFAULT": "0.5rem",
                        "lg": "1rem",
                        "xl": "1.5rem",
                        "full": "9999px"
                    },
                },
            },
        }
    </script>
<style>
        .material-symbols-outlined {
            font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 0, 'wght' 400, 'GRAD' 0, 'opsz' 24;
        }
        .hide-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar {
            display: none;
        }
        .hide-scrollbar {
            -ms-overflow-style: none;
            scrollbar-width: none;
        }
    </style>
<style>
    body {
      min-height: max(884px, 100dvh);
    }
  </style>
  </head>
<body class="bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark font-display text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">
<div class="relative flex min-h-screen w-full flex-col overflow-x-hidden">
<!-- Header -->
<div class="flex items-center bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark p-4 sticky top-0 z-10 border-b border-tea-green/30">
<div class="text-deep-brown dark:text-tea-green flex size-12 shrink-0 items-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">arrow_back</span>
</div>
<h2 class="text-deep-brown dark:text-tea-green text-lg font-bold leading-tight tracking-[-0.015em] flex-1 text-center">精準行銷</h2>
<div class="flex w-12 items-center justify-end">
<button class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl h-12 w-12 bg-transparent text-deep-brown dark:text-tea-green">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">search</span>
</button>
</div>
</div>
<main class="flex-1 pb-24">
<!-- Smart Recommendations Section -->
<div class="px-4 py-6">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
<h2 class="text-deep-brown dark:text-tea-green text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">智慧推薦方案</h2>
<span class="text-tea-accent text-sm font-medium">查看全部</span>
</div>
<div class="flex overflow-x-auto gap-4 hide-scrollbar py-2">
<!-- Card 1 -->
<div class="flex h-full flex-col gap-3 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 shadow-sm min-w-[280px] p-4 border border-tea-green/50">
<div class="w-full h-32 bg-tea-green/30 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden" data-alt="Abstract green tea leaf patterns background">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-tea-accent text-4xl">trending_down</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col flex-1 justify-between gap-4">
<div>
<h3 class="text-deep-brown dark:text-tea-green text-lg font-bold">高流失風險挽回</h3>
<p class="text-tea-accent text-sm font-medium mt-1">目標對象：42 位成員</p>
<p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-xs mt-2 italic">預測 30 天內流失機率 > 75%</p>
</div>
<button class="w-full flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-xl h-11 px-4 bg-primary text-deep-brown text-sm font-bold tracking-wide shadow-sm hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity">
<span class="truncate">發送 85 折優惠券</span>
</button>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Card 2 -->
<div class="flex h-full flex-col gap-3 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 shadow-sm min-w-[280px] p-4 border border-tea-green/50">
<div class="w-full h-32 bg-tea-green/30 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden" data-alt="Minimalist soft green tea steam illustration">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-tea-accent text-4xl">person_add</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col flex-1 justify-between gap-4">
<div>
<h3 class="text-deep-brown dark:text-tea-green text-lg font-bold">新會員黏著度提升</h3>
<p class="text-tea-accent text-sm font-medium mt-1">目標對象：18 位成員</p>
<p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-xs mt-2 italic">註冊未滿 14 天且未二次消費</p>
</div>
<button class="w-full flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-xl h-11 px-4 bg-primary text-deep-brown text-sm font-bold tracking-wide shadow-sm hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity">
<span class="truncate">發送首購見面禮</span>
</button>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Card 3 -->
<div class="flex h-full flex-col gap-3 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 shadow-sm min-w-[280px] p-4 border border-tea-green/50">
<div class="w-full h-32 bg-tea-green/30 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden" data-alt="Golden tea cup silhouette for VIP members">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-tea-accent text-4xl">verified_user</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col flex-1 justify-between gap-4">
<div>
<h3 class="text-deep-brown dark:text-tea-green text-lg font-bold">長期會員回饋</h3>
<p class="text-tea-accent text-sm font-medium mt-1">目標對象：125 位成員</p>
<p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-xs mt-2 italic">年度累積消費前 10% 忠誠客</p>
</div>
<button class="w-full flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-xl h-11 px-4 bg-primary text-deep-brown text-sm font-bold tracking-wide shadow-sm hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity">
<span class="truncate">發送 VIP 專屬邀約</span>
</button>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Audience Segments Section -->
<div class="px-4 py-4">
<div class="flex flex-col mb-4">
<h2 class="text-deep-brown dark:text-tea-green text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">2024 Q2 推薦客群分眾</h2>
<p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm mt-1">基於 AI 模型的最新模型分析數據</p>
</div>
<div class="space-y-4">
<!-- Segment 1 -->
<div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 p-4 rounded-xl border border-tea-green/50 shadow-sm">
<div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-3">
<div>
<span class="inline-block px-2 py-1 rounded bg-tea-green text-tea-accent text-[10px] font-bold uppercase mb-1">High Value</span>
<h4 class="text-deep-brown dark:text-tea-green font-bold">品茗愛好者</h4>
</div>
<div class="text-right">
<div class="text-tea-accent font-bold">88%</div>
<div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">預測轉化率</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 border-t border-tea-green/20 pt-3 mt-3">
<div>
<p class="text-slate-400 text-[11px]">平均滿意度</p>
<div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-deep-brown dark:text-tea-green font-medium">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-yellow-500">star</span>
                                    4.8 / 5.0
                                </div>
</div>
<div>
<p class="text-slate-400 text-[11px]">平均客單價</p>
<div class="text-deep-brown dark:text-tea-green font-medium">NT$ 450</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Segment 2 -->
<div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 p-4 rounded-xl border border-tea-green/50 shadow-sm">
<div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-3">
<div>
<span class="inline-block px-2 py-1 rounded bg-slate-100 text-slate-500 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase mb-1">Growth</span>
<h4 class="text-deep-brown dark:text-tea-green font-bold">週末午茶族</h4>
</div>
<div class="text-right">
<div class="text-tea-accent font-bold">62%</div>
<div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">預測轉化率</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 border-t border-tea-green/20 pt-3 mt-3">
<div>
<p class="text-slate-400 text-[11px]">平均滿意度</p>
<div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-deep-brown dark:text-tea-green font-medium">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-yellow-500">star</span>
                                    4.2 / 5.0
                                </div>
</div>
<div>
<p class="text-slate-400 text-[11px]">平均客單價</p>
<div class="text-deep-brown dark:text-tea-green font-medium">NT$ 280</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Segment 3 -->
<div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 p-4 rounded-xl border border-tea-green/50 shadow-sm opacity-80">
<div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-3">
<div>
<span class="inline-block px-2 py-1 rounded bg-red-50 text-red-500 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase mb-1">Risk</span>
<h4 class="text-deep-brown dark:text-tea-green font-bold">偶爾嘗鮮客</h4>
</div>
<div class="text-right">
<div class="text-red-500 font-bold">24%</div>
<div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">預測轉化率</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 border-t border-tea-green/20 pt-3 mt-3">
<div>
<p class="text-slate-400 text-[11px]">平均滿意度</p>
<div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-deep-brown dark:text-tea-green font-medium">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-yellow-500">star</span>
                                    3.5 / 5.0
                                </div>
</div>
<div>
<p class="text-slate-400 text-[11px]">平均客單價</p>
<div class="text-deep-brown dark:text-tea-green font-medium">NT$ 150</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</main>
<!-- Bottom Navigation Bar -->
<div class="fixed bottom-0 left-0 right-0 flex border-t border-tea-green bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark px-4 pb-6 pt-2 z-20">
<a class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-end gap-1 text-tea-accent/60" href="#">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">bar_chart</span>
<p class="text-xs font-medium leading-normal tracking-[0.015em]">數據分析</p>
</a>
<a class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-end gap-1 text-deep-brown dark:text-tea-green" href="#">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-tea-accent" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">target</span>
<p class="text-xs font-bold leading-normal tracking-[0.015em]">精準行銷</p>
</a>
<a class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-end gap-1 text-tea-accent/60" href="#">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">group</span>
<p class="text-xs font-medium leading-normal tracking-[0.015em]">會員管理</p>
</a>
<a class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-end gap-1 text-tea-accent/60" href="#">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">settings</span>
<p class="text-xs font-medium leading-normal tracking-[0.015em]">設定</p>
</a>
</div>
</div>
</body></html>